  <section><para>Cash kicked a football off a tee. The path of the football is shown below and represented by the function \(f(x)=-0 .02(x-h)^2+k\), where \(x\) represents the horizontal distance and \(f(x)\) represents the height.</para>
<image height="265" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/5f2a84ba5ea778acd94a20c4e1a5d81f7d8d5f46" width="300"/><para>Find the vertex and its meaning.</para></section>
